text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Akoum Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Akoum Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', "Annihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)\\nUlamog's Crusher attacks each combat if able.", 'Annihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)\\nWhenever an opponent sacrifices a nontoken permanent, put that card onto the battlefield under your control.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\\nTarget creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the revealed card's mana value.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control five or more lands, put four +1/+1 counters on Scute Mob.', "Choose two —\\n• Target player gains 7 life.\\n• Put target noncreature permanent on top of its owner's library.\\n• Target player shuffles their graveyard into their library.\\n• Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target creature block Turntimber Basilisk this turn if able.', "Destroy each creature with mana value 3 or less. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Create two 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', "Destroy target tapped creature.\\nAwaken 3—{5}{W} (If you cast this spell for {5}{W}, also put three +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\nIngest (Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top card of their library.)\\nWhen Dominator Drone enters the battlefield, if you control another colorless creature, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Devoid (This card has no color.)\\n{1}: Target colorless creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Affa Guard Hound enters the battlefield, target creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', 'Flying\\nWhen Cadaver Imp enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Butcher of Malakir or another creature you control dies, each opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Forked Bolt deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.', 'Graypelt Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Graypelt Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Kicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Torch Slinger enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'Kicker {2}{B} (You may pay an additional {2}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Heartstabber Mosquito enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, destroy target creature.', 'Kicker {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell.)\\nCreatures target player controls get -1/-1 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, those creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn instead.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Territorial Baloth gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• You gain 2 life.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may gain 2 life.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a quest counter on Khalni Heart Expedition.\\nRemove three quest counters from Khalni Heart Expedition and sacrifice it: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Level up {2} ({2}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-4\\n2/2\\nLEVEL 5+\\n5/5\\nFirst strike', 'Level up {2}{G} ({2}{G}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n4/4\\nLEVEL 4+\\n6/6\\nTrample', 'Level up {2}{W} ({2}{W}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 2-4\\n3/6\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nLEVEL 5+\\n4/8\\nOther creatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Level up {3} ({3}: Put a level counter on this. Level up only as a sorcery.)\\nLEVEL 1-3\\n2/3\\nFlying\\nLEVEL 4+\\n4/4\\nFlying, vigilance', "Put target creature into its owner's library second from the top. Its controller gains 3 life.", 'Rocky Tar Pit enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Rocky Tar Pit: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice all creatures you control, then create that many 4/4 red Hellion creature tokens.', 'Scry 2, then draw two cards. You lose 2 life.', "Stirring Wildwood enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.\\n{1}{G}{W}: Until end of turn, Stirring Wildwood becomes a 3/4 green and white Elemental creature with reach. It's still a land.", 'Tap up to two target creatures.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\nLandfall — If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, that creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn instead.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Graypelt Hunter or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Graypelt Hunter.', 'Turntimber Grove enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Turntimber Grove enters the battlefield, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', "Veteran Warleader's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.\\nTap another untapped Ally you control: Veteran Warleader gains your choice of first strike, vigilance, or trample until end of turn.", 'When Avenger of Zendikar enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token for each land you control.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on each Plant creature you control.', 'When Emrakul\'s Hatcher enters the battlefield, create three 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature tokens. They have "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Ondu Giant enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', 'When you cast this spell, target opponent exiles the top four cards of their library, then you may put any number of land cards that player owns from exile onto the battlefield under your control.', 'When you cast this spell, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nAnnihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', 'Whenever Joraga Bard or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Ally creatures you control gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Whenever Pawn of Ulamog or another nontoken creature you control dies, you may create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Whenever Tajuru Archer or another Ally enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Tajuru Archer deal damage to target creature with flying equal to the number of Allies you control.', "Whenever equipped creature attacks, look at the top card of your library. If it's a land card, you may put it onto the battlefield tapped.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", '{1}, Sacrifice a nonland permanent: Magmaw deals 1 damage to any target.', '{3}{G}, {T}: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{8}: Target creature gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{8}: Target player loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless Eldrazi spells or activate abilities of colorless Eldrazi.']
flavor: ['"\'Invincible\' is just a word."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Before I hire new recruits, I test how long they can hold their breath. You\'d be surprised how often it comes up."\\n—Zahr Gada, Halimar expedition leader', '"Don\'t be fooled. If it were as docile as it looks, it would\'ve died off long ago."\\n—Yon Basrel, Oran-Rief survivalist', '"Life as we know it dangles on the brink of extinction. We must show the strength they would steal from us."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"Others ask why the Eldrazi destroy. I ask why they preserve."\\n—Ganda, Goma Fada deserter', '"Petrifying gaze, deadly fangs, knifelike dorsal spines, venomous saliva . . . Am I missing anything? . . . Toxic bones? Seriously?"\\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House', '"Play no favorites. Everybody dies."\\n—Sparkmage saying', '"Survival rule 781: There are always more scute bugs."\\n—Zurdi, goblin shortcutter', '"The brood lineages unfolded across the world, each patterned after one of three progenitors, each a study in mindless consumption."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"The elders say Zendikar has no safe, peaceful places. How would they know? They\'ve never looked."', '"The purpose of existence is simple: everything is fuel for the magmaw."\\n—Jaji, magmaw worshipper', '"The shadow travels toward the apex. I predict we will soon see the true measure of darkness."', '"This world will not be tamed."', '"We suffer uneasy ground, unstable alliances, and unpredictable magic. Something you can truly trust is worth more than a chest of gold."\\n—Nikou, Joraga bard', '"Whatever the Eldrazi\'s purpose is, it has nothing to do with something so insignificant as us."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"While we delay, they\'re on the move. They will not wait as we bicker. We are losing this war by moments as our goal slips beyond our reach."\\n—Gideon Jura', 'A boon to those who cannot see in the dark. A bane to those who live in it.', "Adventuring bards recite *Chanter's Epics*, never-ending tales that keep their comrades' minds alert to danger.", 'All the angel saw was her doom.', 'As the hedrons began to coalesce into colossal Eldrazi superstructures, the griffins were forced to seek new territory lest their aeries be crushed between the massive stone monoliths.', 'Each temple is a door to a horrible future.', 'Every world is an organism, able to grow new lands. Some just do it faster than others.', "He'll cleave wood and bone alike to carve a path for his allies.", 'His verdict is always guilty. His sentence is always death.', 'Its territory is defined by wherever it is at the moment.', "Just when you thought you'd be safe, in the middle of an open field with no Eldrazi around for miles.", 'Once a welcoming hub for explorers, Affa became a place of guarded tongues and quick defenses.', 'Once thrown, twice burned.', 'Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.', 'Some druids nurture gardens. Others nurture continents.', 'Some humans willingly offered up their blood, hoping it would grant the vampire families the strength to stave off the Eldrazi.', 'The Eldrazi hunger without limit and consume without pause.', 'The Roil redraws the world as it passes, leaving only the hedrons unchanged.', "The dead know lessons the living haven't learned.", 'The mouth must be pried open before rigor mortis sets in. Otherwise the returning soul can find no ingress.', 'What is mana but possibility, an idea not yet given form?', 'Wordlessly it leads its abhorrent brood.', 'Your pleas for death shall go unheard.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Clint Cearley', 'Daarken', 'Dave Kendall', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Erica Yang', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Goran Josic', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Zapata', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'John Avon', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Mike Bierek', 'Philip Straub', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Scott Chou', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
